  "note": "Triennial election of the rural district council, held with the election of the board of guardians: each district electoral division returned its councillors, who were also its guardians. Polled Wednesday 4 June 1902 (\"Polling for the election of County and Rural District Councillors for Tyrone took place on Wednesday last\": Tyrone Constitution, 6 June 1902, p. 5). Ballygawley returned 2 councillors, with a poll. 5 candidates for 2 seats."
